BFI-2 item content (Soto & John 2017, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology 113(1))
  The level-0 sentences of the Big Five sentence bank (simengine/persona/bigfive.py) follow BFI-2 item stems.
  The BFI-2 is (c) Soto & John and is free for non-commercial research use; ask the
  authors before any commercial use.

Published-literature constants (game references, Ertan, Page & Putterman 2009 targets, norm tables,
calibrated weights) are inlined as parameters, each with its citation. They remain the work of their authors.

Third-party datasets are NOT redistributed. In particular this repository does not contain GSS rows (NORC),
Twin-2K-500 data, Anthology backstories, the BeeBench b01 results table, the replicant Ertan result files or
the Ertan, Page & Putterman working paper. Loaders read your own local copy through data_root or
SIMENGINE_DATA, under each dataset's own terms (see README.md, "Veri setleri ve lisanslar").
